flowchart TD
    Start[Create new mod] --> Auth{Selected provider configured?}
    Auth -- no --> Login[Provider setup or ChatGPT login]
    Login --> Brief[Plain-language mod brief]
    Auth -- yes --> Brief
    Brief --> Provider[Selected provider proposes identity and profile]
    Provider --> Validate[Deterministic validation]
    Validate --> Review[User edits and confirms]
    Review --> Paths[Auto-fill root and launcher paths from project ID]
    Paths --> Override{Edit either path?}
    Override -- yes --> ValidatePaths[Validate explicit overrides]
    Override -- no --> Preview[Preview descriptors, thumbnail, and folders]
    ValidatePaths --> Preview
    Preview --> Optional3D[Ask exact 3D workflow question]
    Optional3D --> OptionalSE[Ask exact Super Events workflow question]
    OptionalSE --> DryRun[Dry-run review]
    DryRun --> Apply[Apply: create one reviewed leaf if absent]
    Apply --> Ready[Launcher-ready and Open in Codex]
    Apply -. rollback .-> Empty{Created leaf empty?}
    Empty -- yes --> RemoveLeaf[Remove leaf only]
    Empty -- no --> Preserve[Preserve unknown content and leaf]
    RemoveLeaf --> RolledBack[Rolled back]
    Preserve --> RolledBack
